# this creature gets +2/+0 until end of turn." Bot1 discards an Island on turn 3: a card is drawn and the 0/3 is a 2/3 (power only),
# so Bot2 takes 2; the pump is gone on Bot2's turn 4 (the Detective is a 0/3 again).

